                  </span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-h3 text-h3 text-on-surface dark:text-on-secondary group-hover:text-primary dark:group-hover:text-primary-fixed-dim transition-colors line-clamp-2\">PostgreSQL Migration Runbook (v12 to v15)</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline mt-xs line-clamp-2\">Step-by-step procedures for zero-downtime logical replication upgrades, including fallback strategies and pgBouncer config updates.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-auto pt-md flex items-center justify-between border-t border-outline-variant dark:border-[#21344f]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-xs\">\n<img class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full object-cover\" data-alt=\"A small avatar image for a database administrator, featuring a diverse professional in a dark studio setting with subtle blue rim lighting, perfectly cropped to a circle for a dark-themed UI.\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCaMzpso_fw0JRyXbYTPwbeSO9BuAYePnua042tT9NOcsU-_a8pGEGg30TW0kDaR7YmB9YlnFpkSmhgFZlJP7MHNKouTtfluDHduk79H7EdW_ocyWYuR77Yo1ghxC1pFMRFSnafgikhHe6Y6V895nLIUGlRNyLcFi9EmpkS_hG5y5u6e09yP7V2mOVPbwHgY6W_JV9W59qJyZhZeXuGCRXTONkz9Ij3Li_c7EbLIwwSqkGsVHwiCVHrEM3JPe1FYBAAz6b574Cd_0hf\"/>\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline\">Marcus T.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline font-mono text-[11px]\">\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-[2px]\" title=\"Difficulty: Intermediate\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-yellow-400\">signal_cellular_alt_2_bar</span> Int</span>\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-[2px]\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">visibility</span> 845</span>\n<span>Nov 02</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Card 3 -->\n<div class=\"group flex flex-col bg-surface-container-lowest dark:bg-[#112136] rounded-xl border border-outline-variant dark:border-outline overflow-hidden hover:border-primary dark:hover:border-primary-fixed-dim transition-all duration-300 relative\">\n<div class=\"h-1 w-full bg-primary absolute top-0 left-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n<div class=\"p-md flex flex-col flex-1 gap-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-xs px-2 py-1 rounded bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container font-mono text-[11px] uppercase\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">design_services</span> UX/UI\n                            </span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full border border-outline-variant dark:border-outline text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-[11px]\">\n<span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span> Published\n                            </span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-h3 text-h3 text-on-surface dark:text-on-secondary group-hover:text-primary dark:group-hover:text-primary-fixed-dim transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Component Library: Accessible Forms &amp; Validation</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline mt-xs line-clamp-2\">Guidelines on ARIA attributes, error state announcements, and color contrast requirements for all standard input components.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-auto pt-md flex items-center justify-between border-t border-outline-variant dark:border-[#21344f]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-xs\">\n<img class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full object-cover\" data-alt=\"Avatar of a UI/UX designer, an artistic individual with modern glasses against a dark, moody background, designed to look sleek and fit seamlessly into a premium dark-mode dashboard.\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuA34a324CWDKesexV5nA3xV-kPgmh2t6BPrQzCAsr2NivtIjbMyVwgnkvEP7II98jeIRXjIw3B96NBkJljDimOfB9psf4rRAzBWE9o3y3zvvRCbD_dcdEcpMwn1N2k21cR9Q2efFgqfLxsS5Kp-_ptQDMcfuVBqE9mkRdyXkOeT9N_5s